      "lines": [
        "494. $x$ 取什么值时，不等式组 $\\begin{cases}x>3\\\\ ↵",
        "x<a\\end{cases}$ 无解？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "495",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "495. 解下列不等式组：",
        "а) $\\left\\{x>4,\\right.$ б) $\\left\\{x<1,\\right.$ в) $\\left\\{x>3.5,\\right.$",
        "$x>8,$ $x<5,$ $x>6,$",
        "$x>9,$ $x<2,$ $x<1,$",
        "$x>3;$ $x<0;$ $x<0;$",
        "г) $\\begin{cases}x<-3,\\\\ ↵",
        "x<-2,\\\\ ↵",
        "x<-5,\\\\ ↵",
        "x>8.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "496",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "496. 证明：下列不等式组的解集合是空集：",
        "а) $\\left\\{x^2+1<0,\\right.$ б) $\\left\\{2x-4>2x-1,\\right.$",
        "$3x-1>0;$ $5x>0;$",
        "в) $\\left\\{6x<0,\\right.$ г) $\\left\\{3x+5<0,\\right.$",
        "$3x>0;$ $3x^2+5>0.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "497",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "497. 解不等式组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}0.3x-1<x+0.4,\\\\ ↵",
        "2-3x<5x+1;\\end{cases}$",
        "б) $\\begin{cases}2.5x-0.12>0.6x+0.07,\\\\ ↵",
        "1-2x>-x-4;\\end{cases}$",
        "в) $\\begin{cases}2x+1.4<\\frac{3x-7}{5},\\\\ ↵",
        "2x>3-\\frac{2x}{5};\\end{cases}$",
        "г) $\\begin{cases}3(x-2)(x+2)-3x^2<x,\\\\ ↵",
        "5x-4>4-5x;\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
